From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Projet AuxiNux <repo@auxinux.ca>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 21:55:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] macos: Help menu pages, plain text files in AuxiText, AuxiNux
 build

With _AUXINUX: Help > Acknowledgments / License Agreement use the controller's own window and a file URL built from the path (they did nothing); plain text files opened from the app (open dialog, Finder, drag and drop) go to the bundled AuxiText.app instead of a word processor tab, except after AuxiText's 'Open in AuxiWriter'. The Xcode build scripts that copy resources and libraries are skipped when AUXINUX_BUILD is set (scripts/auxibuild assembles the bundle).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
